 but she trips on  something gets aerated back into the  dark  using your flashlight she's able to  temporarily free herself from the evil  spirit's grip  she immediately hightails it to judy's  room but judy would have her own  confrontation in which malthus would  bring out its full  arsenal of alternate forms  judy sleeps next to a revolving color  wheel lamp a novelty item that dates  back to the 1950s this lamp would have  an unusual effect on the demon malthus  it begins with malthus dragging judy by  the ankle to wake her up  this is exactly how bathsheba woke up  her victims in the conjuring though it's  not clear if bathsheba actually escaped  the music box it was captured in or if  malthus just learned this from the  witch's ghost when they met the previous  year when she wakes up  judy quickly realizes that something is  wrong when she discovers the annabelle  doll underneath the covers with her  b appears from under the covers at the  foot of the bed and scares her causing  her to knock over the color wheel it  continues to spin and projects its  colored light onto the wall as each  color changes a different form of  malthus is displayed  it starts with the doll then b then the  adult version of janus and finally the  rarely seen true form of malthus then it  appears behind her on the bed and  screeches at her she bolts out of the  room where mary ellen is waiting for her  with the black chuck outside they  realize they're trapped in they place a  call to lorraine for help but malthus  has manipulated the phone lines as well  can i speak to annabelle i'm sorry  you need to give her a soul dear  what a soul she wants her soul  give me her soul that's even more  annoying than telemarketers  well no maybe not that annoying before  trying to make an attempt on one of  their souls all of the bells in the  house start ringing which might be  another callback to mrs mullins who had  a bedside hand belt to request hell  then the typewriter goes all jack  torrance and writes the words miss me  over and over a phone starts ringing in  the artifact room and  judy and mary ellen get in there just in  time to stop daniella from touching it  she admits to being the one who let  annabelle out of the case and has bad  news regarding the other spirits in the  room  what else did you touch everything  this sends mary ellen into an asthma  attack but as judy goes to fetch her  inhaler the creepy bride sneaks up on  daniella using the same teleport forward  mechanic that malthus used on mia form  in the stairwell  it appears that she's stabbed daniela in  the stomach but it's only an illusion  she pins her to the ground and pukes  inside her mouth  so for the first time since janus in  1955 malthus has a new vessel  after judy safely returns with the  inhaler daniella tries to beckon the two  of them to go upstairs but judy  taking after her mother's medium  abilities senses something is wrong  and leads mary ellen to try to find the  annabelle doll so they can put an end to  the horror they were living through that  night  they find the cursed children's toy in  the closet inside the warren's office  but the door is locked  so they have to play this board game  feely mealy in order to win the key  i found it a bit strange that this evil  inhuman spirit would just stop in the  middle of everything and strike up a  board game with these kids but when i  went back i realized  that the game is seen in the room of  cursed objects at the beginning so this  is probably another trial where malthus  is manipulating whatever evil spirit was  living in this board game judy is able  to win the key and mary ellen ventures  into the closet which now resembles the  fairy man's tombs she's only able to  toss the doll back to judy before being  pulled back into the abyss but judy  recovers the fumble and makes a break  for the end zone before being met with  daniela who is infused with both the  evil of malthus and the ire of the  wedding dress spirit  mary ellen comes in with the key block  and big brain judy's fast thinking  probably saves a couple of lives when  she turns on a projector with a  recording of ed  performing an exorcism this essentially  seems to have the same effect as him  performing the actual exorcism and  causes immense pain to the demonic  presence inside of her  this buys them just enough time to get  annabelle back to the case but when judy  opens it malthus slams it shut  corners her and attempts to suck out  judy's soul using a dementor's kiss  as you may know the dementor's kiss is  an act performed by the wraith-like  species of prison guards in the  wizarding world aka the harry potter  franchise to suck out the soul of anyone  who gets in their way the controvers in  the wizarding world may both be warner  brothers properties but they're not the  same universe however malthus doesn't  seem to care and he nearly performs the  dementor's kiss on judy mary ellen tries  to come in and save her so malthus gets  in one last air heat and sends her  flying into the wall but this gives judy  just enough time to grab a nearby cross  something she probably should have done  a while ago and press it to malthus's  head  mary ellen places the annabelle doll  back into the chapel glass case but  malthus power prevents her from being  able to force its shots things look  hopeless as all of the escaped evil  spirits from that night surround them  but luckily for them  daniela shows up now free of the demonic  possession she is the only character  that we know of to ever be freed from  malthus's grit and with her strength  they're able to force annabelle's case  closed  i can only imagine that daniela never  actually gave in to the idea of malthus  taking her soul and that's why she was  able to be exercised the doll and the  demonic presence bound to it are once  again sealed and without the spiritual  beacon of the annabelle toll malthus and  the other spirits are no longer able to  materialize in our world  the evil has been contained as far as we  know malthus would remain locked in edin  lorraine warren's cursed artifact room  from that point forward but the real  life story  is perhaps open to another chapter  lorraine warren passed away in april of  2019  and left the cursed artifact room which  is known in real life as the warrens  occult museum to her son-in-law tony  spira that's judy's husband  in 2020 because of course this would  happen in 2020 it was reported that the  annabelle doll had somehow escaped and  was now missing from the room  tony sparrow took to youtube to shoot  down these rumors annabelle's here  she didn't go anywhere she didn't take a  trip  so you know here she is so let's put the  rumors to rest guys  but during this fiasco it also came out  that tony and judy were looking to  relocate the museum which had been  closed for some time due to zoning  issues so it's not hard to imagine a  future controvers story where one of the  movers doesn't take the proper  precautions with the annabelle doll and  malthus is set loose  once more we've seen a lot of these many  years later horror sequels recently so  maybe a modern day annabelle sequel  could eventually be  in the cards let me know in the comments  which other controvers characters or  entities you'd like to see covered here  on horror history and if you love horror  remember to subscribe to cz's world for  new horrors every week  ring the death bell not the spirit bell  for notifications and i will  see you in the next one assuming we both  survive  [Music]
 

